---
---

<section id="top" class="cm-hero">
  <hr class="hr cm-hero-rule" />
  <div class="cm-hero-grid">
    <div class="cm-hero-content">
      <h1>Java-ingenieur uit de Westhoek, te huur per dag.</h1>
      <p class="cm-hero-lead">
        Ex-TomTom, nu freelancer bij Isabel en Liantis. Ik los technische knopen op —
        code, architectuur, cloud — en lever werk dat blijft draaien.
      </p>
      <div class="cm-hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/#contact">Stuur me een bericht</a>
        <span class="cm-hero-note">Of gewoon bellen — ik kom ook ter plaatse.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cm-hero-photo-wrap">
      <img
        class="cm-hero-photo"
        src="/assets/thomas2.jpg"
        alt="Thomas Vankerckhoven"
        width="480"
        height="600"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cm-hero {
    max-width: var(--container-max);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: 0 clamp(20px, 5vw, 56px) clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px);
  }
  .cm-hero-rule {
    margin: 0 0 clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px);
  }
  .cm-hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr clamp(260px, 32vw, 460px);
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 64px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 78px);
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 clamp(20px, 3vw, 32px);
    max-width: 18ch;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .cm-hero-lead {
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.6vw, 20px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .cm-hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .cm-hero-note {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-neutral-700);
  }
  .cm-hero-photo {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% 15%;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-text);
    filter: grayscale(100%);
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .cm-hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .cm-hero-photo-wrap {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
